{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-14","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If there be as many numbers as we please, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali.","book":7,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","contentId":"euclid-7-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01d235fbb84ee8dc58a9b85a7d9f4e192f6da131c707603a13868da19dd17b6e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-14.statement","euclid-7-14.construction.1","euclid-7-14.proof.1","euclid-7-14.proof.2","euclid-7-14.proof.3","euclid-7-14.proof.4","euclid-7-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb5c8cdb49aafd7b7f713808f3311cbb93bc67adad4a991fb22c2e280960906a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be as many numbers as we please, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有我们想得到的多少数字,而其他数字则与数字相同,而两者的比例相同,那么它们也将处于平等之前的相同比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ada858e894aa139b17661e97b350685b53c07a41017c07019716202ec0c85547","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please A, B, C, and others equal to them in multitude D, E, F, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, so that, as A is to B, so is D to E, and, as B is to C, so is E to F; I say that, ex aequali, as A is to C, so also is D to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A、B、C等数字,等等,D、E、F等数字,两者之比相同,A至B等同,D至E之比,B至C等同,E至F之比;我说,平等,A至C之比,A至C之比；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；B 与 C 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5182deb7bc872780812c7df065693888f55225608b5602b0c8a98227c14ea2a9","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since, as A is to B, so is D to E, therefore, alternately, as A is to D, so is B to E. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对B的比等于D对E的比,因此,A对D的比等于B对E的比；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；A 与 D 之比等于 B 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df12142c49218bd98b7050500a80794845492684f1616c5407f82a45b30e1661","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as B is to C, so is E to F, therefore, alternately, as B is to E, so is C to F. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,B对C的比等于E对F的比,因此,B对E的比等于C对F的比；B 与 C 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；B 与 E 之比等于 C 与 F 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75fb7a2d01a788b2cafa3d83020eb21a7e801c553cf47eb5b86980ea810c852a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as B is to E, so is A to D; therefore also, as A is to D, so is C to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,B对E的比等于A对D的比;因此,A对D的比等于C对F的比；B 与 E 之比等于 A 与 D 之比；A 与 D 之比等于 C 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86509c31fc956033c9e90652835047a7bc99f9bd92c3c3a4e0d8a747f7f74719","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, as A is to C, so is D to F. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比C的比例则等于D比F；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-14.source","contentId":"euclid-7-14","revisionId":"euclid-7-14@raw-01d235fbb84ee8dc","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a6fd8c5c988a35555311ce8fada9c38350bc4840eab06efd38441ca798da0ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.14/\nCorpus 